USED eligible_def
⊢ ∀charge request original remaining enabled opened candidate amount reason.
    eligible charge request original remaining enabled opened candidate
      amount reason ⇔
    charge ≠ «» ∧ request ≠ «» ∧ enabled ∧ opened ∧ 0 ≤ original ∧
    original ≤ 9223372036854775807 ∧ 0 ≤ remaining ∧ remaining ≤ original ∧
    candidate ∧ 0 ≤ amount ∧ amount ≤ remaining ∧
    (reason = «duplicate_charge» ∨ reason = «service_not_delivered» ∨
     reason = «returned_item»)
USED refund_run_wire_def
⊢ ∀wire.
    refund_run_wire wire =
    case refund_decode_wire wire of
      INL err => INL err
